cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or its software, please cite it as below, and the papers in references."
type: dataset
title: "SCAI-SCI Gait Dataset"
abstract: >-
  Laboratory motion capture, force plates, surface EMG, and video-derived SMPL body models of
  walking in 240 adults with spinal cord injury, with a clinical table standardized to the
  International SCI Core Data Set v3.0.
# TODO(release): version, date-released and the PhysioNet DOI from the published project
